<title>BRAZIL: Odebrecht '96 consolidated loss vs net.</title>
<headline>Odebrecht '96 consolidated loss vs net.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian construction, chemical and petrochemical group Odebrecht on Thursday issued the following statement on its 1996 results.</p>
<p>			     1996		  1995</p>
<p>    Consolidated loss    23 million		184 million profit</p>
<p>    Holding net	    25 million		153 million</p>
<p>    Gross revs	  4.448 bln	    3.521 bln</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais, under Brazil's corporate law accounting method (not adjusted for inflation).</p>
</text>
